Thieu khoa nay thi Docker lay mac dinh `no`, va mac dinh do KHONG PHAI mot lua chon
ai do da can nhac — no la cho khong ai dien.

Do tren mang cong khai 27/08: ca 9 validator mang restart=no, trong khi Blockscout
mang `always` va Caddy/faucet/web mang `unless-stopped`. Nghia la may chu reboot thi
trang web day, faucet day, EXPLORER day, va chuoi nam im — dang hong te nhat, moi dau
hieu ben ngoai van xanh.

unless-stopped chu khong always: no TON TRONG lenh dung tuong minh, nen rolling-restart
cua M2 van ha duoc mot node xuong ma no khong tu bat len giua chung.

Mat trai cua chinh ve do, da ghi thanh chu trong ma: docker stop VA docker kill deu la
"nguoi dung chu dong dung" nen KHONG kich hoat chinh sach. Thu bang docker kill se thay
node khong day va tuong cau hinh hong — da suyt ket luan sai dung the luc nghiem thu.

Nghiem thu: go vet + go build sach (golang:1.25.10); chay netgen N=3 => compose sinh ra
co 3/3 dong `restart: unless-stopped`.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
